      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14240843/assets/46387d95d8b385f618da53c48284b323bed69e547a2e9894294f03aac7fa104e.png)\n\nThe triangle shown above is rotated by ${90}^{∘}$ counterclockwise about the origin and then reflected across the $x$-axis. What is the resulting triangle?",
      "worked_solution": "Let's apply the given transformation.\n\n- Rotating the triangle by ${90}^{∘}$ counterclockwise about the origin gives the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14240843/assets/e858bc501573ce7290ae6c2c0601d1c5a03d76a44a332ac8a5588e027bc0eacc.png)\n\n- Next, we take the last result and reflect it across the $x$-axis. This gives the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14240843/assets/6eaad9b0fc67babd22039d3c615789babd7469fc3e0822e4f585138750a6e3db.png)",
